  // through the one overworld-entry handler, so without this every overworld entry would replay the 1000 A.D. pan
  // and the flock/fair cutscene seed. The boot chain stages one overworld entry (loc 496); this consumes it.
  // Not derived: the ROM's own gate lives in the C2 cinematic's script (story state).
  int ngIntroDone = 0;
